   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the launch of Growth Investment Partners Zambia (GIP-Z), we aim to provide long-term flexible capital, primarily in local currency, to small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in the country. The goal is to boost business growth and well-being, create jobs, and deepen SME contribution to the Zambian economy. GIP-Z aims to establish itself as a new alternative investment option for long-term capital from local institutional investors in Zambian, driving innovation amongst other financial institutions.</narrative>
   </description>
